Evaluating the same community micro-hydro turbines, freshwater ecologist Nadia Kovacs observes that even low-head intake grates alter downstream sediment transport unless bypass channels are maintained. Consequently, freshwater ecologist Nadia Kovacs cautions against adopting the practice without targeted safeguards.$hdsat_report_fix$, prompt = $hdsat_report_fix$Based on the texts, on what point do energy planner Samuel Osei and freshwater ecologist Nadia Kovacs most clearly differ regarding community micro-hydro turbines?$hdsat_report_fix$, choices = $hdsat_report_fix$[{"id":"A","text":"Both authors conclude that community micro-hydro turbines is obsolete compared with nineteenth-century methods."},{"id":"B","text":"energy planner Samuel Osei studies only laboratory models, whereas freshwater ecologist Nadia Kovacs refuses to consider empirical data."},{"id":"C","text":"energy planner Samuel Osei opposes community micro-hydro turbines on financial grounds, whereas freshwater ecologist Nadia Kovacs supports it unconditionally."},{"id":"D","text":"Energy planner Samuel Osei stresses community micro-hydro turbines's main benefit; freshwater ecologist Nadia Kovacs notes an operational trade-off."}]$hdsat_report_fix$::jsonb, figure_metadata = NULL, skill = $hdsat_report_fix$Cross-Text Connections$hdsat_report_fix$, domain = $hdsat_report_fix$Craft and Structure$hdsat_report_fix$, difficulty = $hdsat_report_fix$Hard$hdsat_report_fix$, format = $hdsat_report_fix$multiple_choice$hdsat_report_fix$, assessments = ARRAY[$hdsat_report_fix$SAT$hdsat_report_fix$, $hdsat_report_fix$PSAT/NMSQT$hdsat_report_fix$, $hdsat_report_fix$PSAT 10$hdsat_report_fix$, $hdsat_report_fix$PSAT 8/9$hdsat_report_fix$]::TEXT[], updated_at = NOW() WHERE id = $hdsat_report_fix$RW-CRF-88430$hdsat_report_fix$;
