UPDATE public.questions SET stimulus = $hdsat_report_fix$Medieval portolan charts plotted coastlines and sailing routes with striking accuracy, and their rhumb lines radiate from compass roses. Yet no surviving chart records the local magnetic declination that navigators would have needed to convert a magnetic bearing into a true bearing. Because uncorrected magnetic bearings would produce growing errors on long voyages, historians infer that ______$hdsat_report_fix$, prompt = $hdsat_report_fix$Which choice most logically completes the text?$hdsat_report_fix$, choices = $hdsat_report_fix$[{"id":"A","text":"portolan charts were copied directly from ancient Roman maps that already showed magnetic declination."},{"id":"B","text":"magnetic declination was too small in the medieval Mediterranean to affect a ship's course."},{"id":"C","text":"chart makers must have used astronomical observations or other corrections that the surviving charts do not preserve."},{"id":"D","text":"medieval navigators avoided long voyages until magnetic declination was formally measured."}]$hdsat_report_fix$::jsonb, figure_metadata = NULL, skill = $hdsat_report_fix$Inferences$hdsat_report_fix$, domain = $hdsat_report_fix$Information and Ideas$hdsat_report_fix$, difficulty = $hdsat_report_fix$Hard$hdsat_report_fix$, format = $hdsat_report_fix$multiple_choice$hdsat_report_fix$, assessments = ARRAY[$hdsat_report_fix$SAT$hdsat_report_fix$, $hdsat_report_fix$PSAT/NMSQT$hdsat_report_fix$, $hdsat_report_fix$PSAT 10$hdsat_report_fix$, $hdsat_report_fix$PSAT 8/9$hdsat_report_fix$]::TEXT[], updated_at = NOW() WHERE id = $hdsat_report_fix$RW-INF-M29-02$hdsat_report_fix$;
UPDATE public.question_keys SET correct_answer = $hdsat_report_fix$C$hdsat_report_fix$, acceptable_answers = ARRAY[$hdsat_report_fix$C$hdsat_report_fix$]::TEXT[], explanation = $hdsat_report_fix$The passage sets up a puzzle: the charts are accurate, but they do not record the declination needed to turn magnetic readings into true bearings. The most logical inference is that corrections existed in another form and were not written on the surviving charts.$hdsat_report_fix$, distractor_rationales = $hdsat_report_fix${"A":"The passage gives no evidence that Roman maps already recorded magnetic declination.","B":"If declination were negligible, the passage would not describe cumulative errors on long voyages.","D":"The passage says the charts were used for sailing routes, not that long voyages were avoided."}$hdsat_report_fix$::jsonb, updated_at = NOW() WHERE question_id = $hdsat_report_fix$RW-INF-M29-02$hdsat_report_fix$;
